@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Identity
@using Gift_of_Givers.Models
@inject SignInManager<ApplicationUser> SignInManager
@inject UserManager<ApplicationUser> UserManager

<ul class="navbar-nav">
    @if (SignInManager.IsSignedIn(User))
    {
        <li class="nav-item">
            <span class="nav-link">
                Hello, @UserManager.GetUserName(User)!
            </span>
        </li>

        <li class="nav-item">
            <form asp-page="/Accounts/Logout"
                  method="post">
                <button type="submit"
                        class="nav-link btn btn-link">
                    Logout
                </button>
            </form>
        </li>
    }
    else
    {
        <li class="nav-item">
            <a class="nav-link"
               asp-page="/Accounts/Login">
                Login
            </a>
        </li>

        <li class="nav-item">
            <a class="nav-link"
               asp-page="/Accounts/Register">
                Register
            </a>
        </li>
    }
</ul>